<https://www.purl.org/mso-em> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "MSO-EM is a system of ontologies for documenting the knowledge status of models and data; the aim is to make models and data explainable-AI-ready (XAIR)."@en;
                              <http://purl.org/dc/terms/bibliographicCitation> "M. T. Horsch, S. Chiacchiera, I. T. Todorov, A. T. Correia, A. Dey, N. A. Konchakova, S. Scholze, S. Stephan, K. Tøndel, A. Sarkar, M. H. Karray, F. Al Machot, B. Schembera, 'Exploration of key concepts required for mid- and domain-level ontology development to facilitate explainable-AI-readiness of data and models,' submitted, 2024."@en;
